# Infinite Guideline Station {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} (all five colors, so multicolored), 7/15 at 12+: "When it enters, create a tapped 2/2 colorless Robot artifact creature token for each
# multicolored permanent you control." Bot1 has Genemorph Imago ({G}{U}) and a Mother of Runes (only white); Bot2 has a Genemorph Imago too, which is not Bot1's. Counted as the
# ability resolves: the Genemorph and the Station itself, so two tapped Robots - not the mono-colored Mother, not the colorless Moxen, not Bot2's. The Robots, Genemorph and Mother
# station it (2 + 2 + 1 + 1 = 6) on turn 5 and again on turn 7: 8, 10, 11 (still no creature, no flying) and 12 - a 7/15 flying artifact creature. It attacks and draws a card for each
# multicolored permanent Bot1 controls, two (the Robots are colorless): the hand of two Islands from turns 5 and 7 and the two cards, 4.

